  "remarks": "PJSC Yuzhuralzoloto Group of Companies is one of the largest gold mining companies in the Russian Federation. It operates multiple goldmines in Russia. The export of precious metals is one of the most significant sources of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. As of 2025, Russia is the second largest gold producing country in the world. Therefore, PJSC Yuzhuralzoloto Group of Companies is involved in economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
